{
  "esm": "1.2.0",
  "metadata": {
    "name": "godunov_upwind_D1x_interior",
    "description": "Interior-only per-axis quantity diff2x of fire_behavior's classical Godunov level-set option (fire_upwinding = 4) on cartesian_uniform_2d over [2, NX-1] x [1, NY], where the three-point stencil along x fits: from the backward difference D- = (u[i,j] - u[i-1,j])/dx and the forward difference D+ = (u[i+1,j] - u[i,j])/dx (index shifted along x), each cell takes stencils/godunov_eno1_D1 -- the ENO1 minmod of D-, D+ within bdy_eno1_cells of any wall (fire_behavior's BDY_ENO1 band, which overrides every upwinding option), and the Godunov-upwind quantity max(D-, 0) - min(D+, 0) elsewhere. The Godunov quantity is the per-axis building block whose squares sum to the Godunov Hamiltonian only up to the cross term (max(D-,0) - min(D+,0))^2 = max(D-,0)^2 + min(D+,0)^2 - 2 max(D-,0) min(D+,0) >= the Rouy-Tourin Hamiltonian's per-axis term; fire_behavior uses it for the front NORMAL (nvx = diff2x / sqrt(grad^2 + eps)), while |grad psi| itself comes from godunov_norm_D2_*. First order; exact on a linear field with positive slope along x (both branches return the slope). See stencils/godunov_eno1_D1 for the sign caveat (outside the wall band, a magnitude for negative slopes). Free name bdy_eno1_cells (>= 1), resolved in the consuming model's scope like the grid geometry dx, dy.",
    "license": "MIT",
    "tags": [
      "esd:stencil",
      "family:finite_difference",
      "grid:cartesian_uniform_2d",
      "op:D",
      "axes:x,y",
      "order:1",
      "stencil_width:3"
    ],
    "references": [
      {
        "citation": "Osher, S., & Sethian, J. A. (1988). Fronts propagating with curvature-dependent speed: Algorithms based on Hamilton-Jacobi formulations. Journal of Computational Physics, 79(1), 12-49.",
        "doi": "10.1016/0021-9991(88)90002-2"
      },
      {
        "citation": "NCAR Community Fire Behavior Model (fire_behavior), develop @ eb77580, physics/level_set_mod.F90: Calc_tend_ls, Select_eno, Select_weno5, Select_4th, Select_godunov (case 4), Extrapol_var_at_bdys. The transcribed reference implementation."
      }
    ]
  },
  "expression_template_imports": [
    {
      "ref": "../grid.esm"
    },
    {
      "ref": "godunov_eno1_D1.esm"
    }
  ],
  "expression_templates": {
    "godunov_upwind_D1x_interior": {
      "params": [
        "u"
      ],
      "body": {
        "op": "faq",
        "output_idx": [
          "i",
          "j"
        ],
        "args": [
          "u"
        ],
        "ranges": {
          "i": [
            2,
            {
              "op": "-",
              "args": [
                "NX",
                1
              ]
            }
          ],
          "j": {
            "from": "y"
          }
        },
        "expr": {
          "op": "apply_expression_template",
          "args": [],
          "name": "godunov_eno1_D1",
          "bindings": {
            "dl": {
              "op": "/",
              "args": [
                {
                  "op": "-",
                  "args": [
                    {
                      "op": "index",
                      "args": [
                        "u",
                        "i",
                        "j"
                      ]
                    },
                    {
                      "op": "index",
                      "args": [
                        "u",
                        {
                          "op": "-",
                          "args": [
                            "i",
                            1
                          ]
                        },
                        "j"
                      ]
                    }
                  ]
                },
                "dx"
              ]
            },
            "dr": {
              "op": "/",
              "args": [
                {
                  "op": "-",
                  "args": [
                    {
                      "op": "index",
                      "args": [
                        "u",
                        {
                          "op": "+",
                          "args": [
                            "i",
                            1
                          ]
                        },
                        "j"
                      ]
                    },
                    {
                      "op": "index",
                      "args": [
                        "u",
                        "i",
                        "j"
                      ]
                    }
                  ]
                },
                "dx"
              ]
            },
            "i": "i",
            "j": "j"
          }
        }
      }
    }
  }
}
